WEBVTT

00:13:27.676 --> 00:13:31.996
but we have to do more,
and we need to develop,

00:13:31.996 --> 00:13:34.556
for instance, we need to develop a system

00:13:34.596 --> 00:13:37.076
for integrating indirect emissions.

00:13:37.116 --> 00:13:39.396
emissions produced outside Oslo

00:13:39.436 --> 00:13:42.836
that are related to the activities
and life in the city.

00:13:43.236 --> 00:13:45.316
But we are working on it.

00:13:46.116 --> 00:13:50.236
Let me finish by telling you
how I move around in the city.

00:13:50.236 --> 00:13:51.996
I walk.

00:13:52.956 --> 00:13:57.436
I haven't mentioned two
core aspects of urban mobility yet,

00:13:57.476 --> 00:13:59.036
walking and biking.

00:13:59.036 --> 00:14:01.556
The city began, years ago,